krit text by Sage Valmiki treats his ten heads as a physical reality.\n\nValmiki frequently refers to him by titles like Dashagriva (ten-necked) and Dashanan (ten-faced)\n\nIn the Uttara Kanda of the Valmiki Ramayana, it is explained that Ravana was born with ten heads. Later, during an intense penance to please Lord Brahma, he offered his heads into a sacrificial fire one by one. Every time he severed a head, a new one grew back. Brahma eventually granted him a boon of invincibility and restored all ten of his heads,\n\nWhen Hanuman first infiltrates Lanka in the Sundara Kanda and beholds Ravana sleeping in his palace, the text describes his vast body, his twenty arms, and his ten heads resting on pillows", "timestamp": 1792431100, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kiddiesanskar", "author_id": "78045503882", "id": "18080284946439178", "text": "My sis said i dont have to imagine 😭✌️", "timestamp": 1792425898, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "xx_momolover_xx", "author_id": "78636495628", "id": "18133342828666000", "text": "The burning of Ravan's putla is not a tradition, it isn't written in any Puranas as well because Ravan was one of the most famous bhakt of Shivji, his death  even bought sadness to Shivji and we should not burn his putla, no one can escape any of human nature like anger and etc, not even gods, burning it isn't meaningful, we should learn to suppress it where people are trying to get reactions, and Ravan was lost because of lust and pride and we should also control our lust and not be arrogant and doing it is harder than saying it because even i can't control it all the time, but at the end it's our efforts, so All the Best to yall", "timestamp": 1792336804, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "pranav_1106", "author_id": "44732592367", "id": "18073949150729243", "text": "Sfx work is simply 🙌🔥", "timestamp": 1792168188, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "01darknight0", "author_id": "65955212356", "id": "18132606451775761", "text": "It needs to be studied y this channel aint famous", "timestamp": 1792084496, "like_count": 37}, {"author": "kundali.samadhan", "author_id": "35439822633", "id": "18380898766239469", "text": "😍😍😍😍", "timestamp": 1791719596, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "siddhiissooosidhi", "author_id": "68189982636", "id": "17911554402520700", "text": "That is actually hyperbole because afterall ramayan is also literature (btw can understand the humour🫶🏻)", "timestamp": 1791707253, "like_count": 9}, {"author": "aadich6969", "author_id": "49235743181", "id": "18382423804227202", "text": "Sleepy", "timestamp": 1791687830, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeTVlJzxleH/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeTVlJzxleH", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/842767885_18123874816755882_121101971999429463_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAwNDYzOTQwNTc5MjE4ODI5NQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=SWPdIjdX24MQ7kNvwFutcGk&_nc_oc=Adr5vB_lBpOxe-od9JlFUkYrPFvPbyfvT94mPMJ5jOyPKTiJhgqOZj8RfDPz1rUvkSnaYifuyCrcjHDZO-_i3U3i&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna&_nc_gid=6WLMprYTrrwUHj0HK52UMw&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQStZiix-EI9rr-OBBy3Iew3y5ClDusqMFAOaTzwyERdFw&oe=6AF819C8", "display_id": "DeTVlJzxleH", "fulltitle": "Video by therishikatha", "upload_date": "20261010", "epoch": 1794258668, "format": "dash-2351649892313168v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-2351596205651870a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-2351649892313168v+dash-2351596205651870a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 3693.341, "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.40.08.00.02.02.05.00", "vbr": 3637.444, "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "abr":